#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-analogue.rst:5 b434c9d0d47c4edea4983db416ae18eb
msgid "Analogue Wind Vane"
msgstr "模拟风向标"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-analogue.rst:7 8f1f921d297048f68a492e899b6cd38e
msgid ""
"This analogue voltage wind vane can be used with any sensor providing a "
"analogue voltage linearly proportional to the wind direction."
msgstr "该模拟电压风向标可与任何提供与风向线性成比例的模拟电压的传感器配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-analogue.rst:9 597ad75ed77249adb01d867c17fbdf01
msgid ""
":ref:`WNDVN_TYPE <WNDVN_TYPE>` = 3, this wind vane relies on the reading "
"voltage on a ADC pin defined by :ref:`WNDVN_DIR_PIN <WNDVN_DIR_PIN>`. The "
"maximum and minimum voltage should be set. This can be done by manually by "
"setting :ref:`WNDVN_DIR_V_MIN <WNDVN_DIR_V_MIN>` and :ref:`WNDVN_DIR_V_MAX "
"<WNDVN_DIR_V_MAX>` but it is recommended that automatic calibration is used."
" To trigger this the :ref:`WNDVN_CAL <WNDVN_CAL>` parameter should be set to"
" one.  A message will appear saying \"WindVane: Calibration started, rotate "
"wind vane\" the vane should then be slowly rotated for 30 seconds until "
"\"WindVane: Calibration complete\" is seen. If the wind vane is set up "
"correctly you should see the wind direction value increase as you turn the "
"vane clockwise, it should reach both zero and 359 degrees. If this is not "
"the case double check the sensor is wired such that a clockwise movement "
"provides a increasing voltage and check the min and max voltage parameters "
"are sensible. The vehicle should then the pointed north so that the yaw "
"angle is zero and the vane set such that it points to the front of the "
"vehicle as if it were head to wind. The negative of wind_dir value should "
"then be set to the :ref:`WNDVN_DIR_OFS <WNDVN_DIR_OFS>` parameter. The "
"wind_dir value should now be zero and read 90 degrees when turned 90 degrees"
" clockwise and read 270 degrees when turned 90 degrees anticlockwise. If "
"your sensor has a large dead zone where it passes from maximum to minimum "
"voltage some improvement may be gained by setting :ref:`WNDVN_DIR_DZ "
"<WNDVN_DIR_DZ>` to a suitable angle, a dead zone value may be provided in "
"the sensor's data sheet."
msgstr ""
":ref:`WNDVN_TYPE <WNDVN_TYPE>` = 3，此风向标依赖于由 :ref:`WNDVN_DIR_PIN "
"<WNDVN_DIR_PIN>` 定义的 ADC 引脚上的电压读数。应设置最大和最小电压，可手动通过设置 :ref:`WNDVN_DIR_V_MIN "
"<WNDVN_DIR_V_MIN>` 和 :ref:`WNDVN_DIR_V_MAX <WNDVN_DIR_V_MAX>` "
"完成，但建议使用自动校准。触发方法是将 :ref:`WNDVN_CAL <WNDVN_CAL>` 参数设为1，将出现消息「WindVane: "
"Calibration started, rotate wind vane」，之后应缓慢旋转风向标30秒，直到出现「WindVane: "
"Calibration "
"complete」。若风向标设置正确，顺时针旋转时应能看到风向值增大，且应到达0度和359度两端。若不符合，请检查传感器接线，确保顺时针旋转时提供递增电压，并检查最小和最大电压参数是否合理。然后应将车辆朝向正北使偏航角为零，并将风向标指向车辆前方，模拟顶风。随后将"
" wind_dir 值取反赋给 :ref:`WNDVN_DIR_OFS <WNDVN_DIR_OFS>` 参数。wind_dir "
"值现在应为零，顺时针转90度时读取90度，逆时针转90度时读取270度。若传感器有较大死区（从最大到最小电压过渡区域），可将 "
":ref:`WNDVN_DIR_DZ <WNDVN_DIR_DZ>` 设为合适角度（传感器数据手册可能提供死区值）来改善性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-analogue.rst:22
#: de0d25130c3a4c109dd7cb82a5ff82bb
msgid "Wind vane construction"
msgstr "风向标制作"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-analogue.rst:24
#: 819c87638f1c45509b50f70e1bfbc299
msgid ""
"A DIY wind vane can be constructed from a 360 degree rotation potentiometer."
" A Bourns `6630S0D-C28-A103 <https://www.bourns.com/docs/product-"
"datasheets/6630.pdf>`__ has been used with success and is easy to get hold "
"of. However it takes quite a large force to rotate. A more free-turning one "
"would provide better results. If you find a better one please `tell us "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/sailboat-support/32060>`__! The outer pins "
"of the potentiometer should be wired to a voltage less than the voltage "
"rating of the ADC pin you plan on using. If using a 6.6V ADC the "
"potentiometer can be wired to 5V and ground. If using a 3.3V ADC the "
"potentiometer can be wired to 3.3V if available or for a 10k potentiometer a"
" 5.6k resistor can be used to drop 5V down to less than 3.3V. As the "
"potentiometer passes from maximum to minimum output voltage the wiper pin is"
" briefly floating, it is recommended to use a high value pull down resistor "
"of around 100k. The outer pins of the potentiometer should be connected in "
"such a way that rotating the potentiometer clockwise will result in an "
"increasing voltage."
msgstr ""
"DIY 风向标可由360度旋转电位计制成。Bourns `6630S0D-C28-A103 "
"<https://www.bourns.com/docs/product-datasheets/6630.pdf>`__ "
"已被成功使用，且易于获取，但旋转所需力道较大。旋转更顺滑的电位计效果更好。如果您找到更好的，请 `告知我们 "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/sailboat-"
"support/32060>`__！电位计的外侧引脚应接到低于所计划使用的 ADC 引脚电压额定值的电压。若使用6.6V "
"ADC，电位计可接5V和地。若使用3.3V "
"ADC，电位计可直接接3.3V（若可用），或对于10k电位计，可用5.6k电阻将5V降至低于3.3V。由于电位计从最大输出电压过渡到最小输出电压时，滑片引脚会短暂悬空，建议使用约100k的大阻值下拉电阻。电位计外侧引脚的接法应使顺时针旋转时输出电压递增。"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-analogue.rst:33
#: 147c63bf764046cca86c037a99791926
msgid ""
"In testing so far it has been found that the potentiometer is not very "
"accurate. An accuracy of +- 20 degrees around the a full rotation is "
"acceptable. The potentiometer should however be repeatable."
msgstr "测试发现，电位计的精度不高。在整圈旋转范围内 ±20 度的精度是可以接受的，但电位计应具有良好的重复性。"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-analogue.rst:35
#: 5c6ed72464b646d699abefe1206ee257
msgid ""
"A wind vane should be constructed to provide the maximum force to turn the "
"potentiometer. A larger wind vane will be more effective in lighter winds "
"than a smaller one. It is recommended to mount the vane as high as possible "
"so that it is in clear wind. The vane must be balanced about the pivot point"
" so that the heel angle of the craft does not change the reading. The weight"
" of a well balanced vane has little effect; it can be directly mounted to "
"the shaft of the potentiometer."
msgstr ""
"风向标的设计应尽量使旋转电位计的力道最大化。较大的风向标在微风中比较小的更有效。建议将风向标安装在尽可能高的位置，以获得不受遮挡的风。风向标必须在旋转轴处保持平衡，使船体的横倾角不会影响读数。平衡良好的风向标重量影响很小；它可以直接安装在电位计的轴上。"
